  "title": "MySQL: add support for progress reporting MariaDB extension",
  "description": "MariaDB has a protocol extension that adds progress reporting for things like long running `ALTER TABLE` etc. This adds support for that.\n\nThe packets are basically extended error packets.\n\nDocs: https://mariadb.com/docs/server/reference/product-development/mariadb-internals/using-mariadb-with-your-programs-api/progress-reporting\n\n![image](/uploads/494bcb8c78c5e8e42a7a66fffc052c74/image.png){width=804 height=600}",
